OL,3,ACalls to plan ahead for Reading
OL,4,AFestival impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith about 100,000 people set to arrive
OL,7,Fnext week for the Reading Festival,
OL,8,Fresidents and festivalgoers alike are
OL,9,Furged to plan ahead.
OL,11,FReading Borough Council has asked
OL,12,Fpeople travelling to the town centre
OL,13,Fahead of the festival ` which runs from
OL,14,FThursday 27 August to Sunday 30 August
OL,15,F` to be prepared for longer travel
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,18,FThey are expected to settle down on the
OL,19,FSaturday and Sunday but shops and
OL,20,Fsupermarkets are expected to be busier
OL,21,Fthan usual.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
